<title>Somatization: Diagnosis.</title>
<graphic href="eee0634-w0001.gif" />
<cell type="start" id="cell-1">
<label>History and physical examination, review of old records, and appropriate screening laboratory work or imaging. Evidence of organic disease?</label>
<path target="cell-2">No</path>
<path target="cell-3">Yes</path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-2">
<label>Meets criteria for depression, anxiety, substance abuse, or personality disorder?</label>
<path target="cell-4">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-5">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-4">
<label>Treat psychiatric issues.</label>
<path target="cell-5"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-5">
<label>Multiple vague symptoms with a chronic course?</label>
<path target="cell-6">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-8">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-6">
<label>Somatization. Consider PHQ-15 to confirm diagnosis.</label>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-3">
<label>Appropriate diagnostic studies and treatment for medical illness.</label>
<path target="cell-7"></path>
</cell>
<cell type="decision" id="cell-7">
<label>Inadequate or incomplete response?</label>
<path target="cell-2">Yes</path>
<path target="cell-8">No</path>
</cell>
<cell type="action" id="cell-8">
<label>Follow-up as appropriate.</label>
</cell>
